qi\" id=\"interests-card-54384033\">Share a list</h2><p class=\"tss-1xywzqw-p-truncate MuiBox-root mui-0\">Lists allow you to keep track of items of interest so you can refer to them whenever you want. You may use lists for a variety of purposes. </p><a class=\"MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary tss-1lv78wq-normal-normalFontSize mui-wsj4a\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"interests-card-54384033\" href=\"/lists\" data-testid=\"learn-more-interests-card-54384033\"><span class=\"MuiBox-root mui-t7olvr\">Learn more</span></a></div><div class=\"tss-19qhrot-truncate MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"tss-1x0fvju-imageContainer MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"tss-170vpu5-img\" style=\"overflow:hidden;position:relative;width:100%;max-width:364px\"><img style=\"display:block;width:100%\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIzNjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjA0Ij48L3N2Zz4=\" aria-hidden=\"true\" alt=\"\"/><img aria-hidden=\"true\" alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"background-color:#1074c3;transition:opacity 500ms;opacity:1;position:absolute;left:-5%;top:-5%;width:110%;height:110%;max-width:none;max-height:none\"/><noscript><picture><source srcSet=\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.25&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=webp&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.5&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=webp&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.75&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=webp&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&amp;fm=webp&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=1.5&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=webp&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 546w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\" type=\"image/webp\"/><source srcSet=\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.25&amp;fit=max&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.5&amp;fit=max&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.75&amp;fit=max&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=1.5&amp;fit=max&amp;h=242&amp;w=364 546w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\"/><img src=\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&amp;h=242&amp;w=364\" alt=\"hands over keyboard of a laptop\" title=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;max-width:none;max-height:none\" loading=\"lazy\"/></picture></noscript></div><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 tss-vcqq0z-label mui-1n5dns5\">Create an account </p></div><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 tss-9kze14-h2-truncate mui-t1j1qi\" id=\"interests-card-144709704\">Create an account </h2><p class=\"tss-1xywzqw-p-truncate MuiBox-root mui-0\">In two minutes, learn to create a WorldCat.org profile, add items to lists, generate citations, and refine your search using facets. </p><a class=\"MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary tss-1lv78wq-normal-normalFontSize mui-wsj4a\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"interests-card-144709704\"