y-1419271880\" lang=\"en\">Web accessibility cookbook : creating inclusive experiences</h3></a><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 mui-1n5dns5\">Manuel Matuzović</p></div></div></div><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-0\" style=\"opacity:0;visibility:hidden\"><div class=\"tss-iyrxei-grid-carouselHeight MuiBox-root mui-1xmiay7\" data-testid=\"featuredStaff-4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Slide 5 of 5\" aria-live=\"polite\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\"><div class=\"tss-xm45v6-root MuiBox-root mui-0\"><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover tss-1cxpzkn-root mui-1prf55u\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" lang=\"en\" data-testid=\"list-item-summary-link-1431047837\" aria-labelledby=\"list-item-summary-1431047837\" href=\"/title/1431047837\"><span class=\"MuiBox-root mui-15gfxpb\"><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-k008qs\"><img alt=\"Front cover image for Practical web accessibility : a comprehensive guide to digital inclusion\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"tss-1holrzy-coverLoading\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1612803378-coverart-default.svg&amp;w=140&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"tss-1hjblz8-placeHolder MuiBox-root mui-0\"></div></div></span><h3 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 tss-6hnoxl-title mui-1im5n10\" id=\"list-item-summary-1431047837\" data-testid=\"list-item-summary-1431047837\" lang=\"en\">Practical web accessibility : a comprehensive guide to digital inclusion</h3></a><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 mui-1n5dns5\">Ashley Firth</p></div></div></div><button class=\"MuiButtonBase-root MuiIconButton-root MuiIconButton-sizeMedium tss-164m78g-sideButtons mui-zal2a8\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\" data-testid=\"next-slide-button-featuredStaff\"><svg class=\"MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-7j8jl\" focusable=\"false\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8.59,16.58L13.17,12L8.59,7.41L10,6L16,12L10,18L8.59,16.58Z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-1o70xks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Select a slide to display\"><button class=\"tss-1tesgo8-button-selected\" title=\"featuredStaffslide-0\" aria-label=\"Slide 1 selected\" data-testid=\"featuredStaffslide-0-button\"></button><button class=\"tss-1og5za4-button\" title=\"featuredStaffslide-1\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\" data-testid=\"featuredStaffslide-1-button\"></button><button class=\"tss-1og5za4-button\" title=\"featuredStaffslide-2\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\" data-testid=\"featuredStaffslide-2-button\"></button><button class=\"tss-1og5za4-button\" title=\"featuredStaffslide-3\" aria-label=\"Slide 4\" data-testid=\"featuredStaffslide-3-button\"></button><button class=\"tss-1og5za4-button\" title=\"featuredStaffslide-4\" aria-label=\"Slide 5\" data-testid=\"featuredStaffslide-4-button\"></button></div><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-0\" hidden=\"\" id=\"featuredStaff-aria-description\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">Slide 1 of 5 now shown</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tss-159q7d1-row-howToUseRow MuiBox-root mui-0\"><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 tss-n979wg-rowHeading mui-t1j1qi\">How to use WorldCat.org</h2><div class=\"tss-m3jeqp-centered-howToUseGrid MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"tss-xee8kb-root MuiBox-root mui-0\"><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-t1j1qi\" id=\"howtouse-54384028\">Welcome to WorldCat.org</h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 tss-1dwgodg-p mui-1n5dns5\">Get started with WorldCat.org. In about two minutes, you can learn how to make a WorldCat.org profile, create and add items to lists, export citations, and use facets to narrow your search criteria. It’s a quick way to introduce yourself to the basics of searching the world’s largest collection of information about materials in libraries.</p><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways tss-1cxpzkn-root mui-1wrtcq1\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" lang=\"en\" data-testid=\"howtouse-learn-more-54384028\" aria-labelledby=\"howtouse-54384028\" href=\"/topics/welcome\">Learn more</a></div><div class=\"tss-xee8kb-root MuiBox-root mui-0\"><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-t1j1qi\" id=\"howtouse-54384029\">Use WorldCat.org for school research</h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 tss-1dwgodg-p mui-1n5dns5\">Learn additional basic and advanced search techniques in this simple tutorial. We’ll walk through how to get resources for a solar system report that a student might be assigned and also provide tips for college students and more advanced researchers.</p><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways tss-1cxpzkn-root mui-1wrtcq1\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" lang=\"en\" data-testid=\"howtouse-learn-more-54384029\" aria-labelledby=\"howtouse-54384029\" href=\"/topics/search\">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class=\"tss-1y4gm05-row-centered-largeGraphicRow MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"tss-1uxm38z-graphicContainer MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"tss-mx06ap-graphic\" style=\"overflow:hidden;position:relative;width:100%;max-width:452px\"><img style=\"display:block;width:100%\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0NTIiIGhlaWdodD0iNDUyIj48L3N2Zz4=\" aria-hidden=\"true\" alt=\"\"/><img aria-hidden=\"true\" alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" style=\"background-color:#a9744e;transition:opacity 500ms;opacity:1;position:absolute;left:-5%;top:-5%;width:110%;height:110%;max-width:none;max-height:none\"/><noscript><picture><source srcSet=\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.25&amp;fm=webp 113w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.5&amp;fm=webp 226w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.75&amp;fm=webp 339w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?fm=webp 452w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\" type=\"image/webp\"/><source srcSet=\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.25 113w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.5 226w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.75 339w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png 452w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\"/><img src=\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png\" alt=\"worldcat.org genealogy topic page\" title=\"Genealogy\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;max-width:none;max-height:none\" loading=\"lazy\"/></picture></noscript></div></div><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-hoe9xz\"><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-t1j1qi\" id=\"graphic-row-54384030\">Genealogy</h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 tss-j86g8b-bodyCopy mui-1n5dns5\">If you’re interested in genealogy or family history, you’re in the right place. Libraries and archives are often the only source for unique, local information about cemetery, burial, and military records; family Bibles, church, and town histories; indexes of births, marriages, and deaths; photographs, newspapers, microfilm, and so much more.</p><a class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways tss-1cxpzkn-root mui-5kyvcw\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" lang=\"en\" data-testid=\"dynamic-router-link\" aria-labelledby=\"graphic-row-54384030\" href=\"/topics/genealogy\">Learn more</a></div></div><div class=\"tss-lqdygc-row-exploreFormatsRow MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"tss-n979wg-rowHeading MuiBox-root mui-0\"><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-t1j1qi\">Explore resources in libraries worldwide</h2></div><div class=\"tss-1nmuqya-centered-exploreFormatsGrid MuiBox-root mui-0\"><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-11nt0r1\"><img alt=\"Books\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"95\" height=\"92\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1631281099-books.svg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1631281099-books.svg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1631281099-books.svg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-ypw117\"><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 tss-1bifiml-formatText mui-1vf655j\">Books</p><p class=\"tss-1j0o0ps-numberString\">405 million</p></div></div><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-11nt0r1\"><img alt=\"Articles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"95\" height=\"92\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1635515431-article-chapter.svg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1635515431-article-chapter.svg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1635515431-article-chapter.svg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-ypw117\"><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 tss-1bifiml-formatText mui-1vf655j\">Articles</p><p class=\"tss-1j0o0ps-numberString\">440 million</p></div></div><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-11nt0r1\"><img alt=\"Sound recordings\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"95\" height=\"92\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.datocms-assets.com%2F29926%2F1631281138-sound-recordings.svg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https