217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fit=max\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fit=max\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?fit=max\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=1.5\\u0026fit=max\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 546w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.25\\u0026fit=max\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fit=max\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fit=max\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?fit=max\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=1.5\\u0026fit=max\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364 546w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?fit=max\\u0026h=242\\u0026w=364\",\"width\":364,\"height\":204,\"aspectRatio\":1.7822349570200573,\"alt\":\"Hands flipping through a book at a table\",\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#c97836\"}},\"label\":\"Trending titles \",\"relativeLinkHref\":\"/lists/d7a8ffa7-8051-4ac5-8eda-5ddce72ee43c\",\"title\":\"Trending titles\",\"description\":\"Here are the ten books most frequently requested for interlibrary loan each month. \"}],\"featuredStaffList\":[{\"listId\":\"40adb58c-db5f-4f2d-9de3-5163b8651f9a\"}],\"howToUseContent\":[{\"id\":\"54384028\",\"heading\":\"Welcome to WorldCat.org\",\"image\":null,\"link\":\"/topics/welcome\",\"bodyCopy\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eGet started with WorldCat.org. In about two minutes, you can learn how to make a WorldCat.org profile, create and add items to lists, export citations, and use facets to narrow your search criteria. It\\u0026rsquo;s a quick way to introduce yourself to the basics of searching the world\\u0026rsquo;s largest collection of information about materials in libraries.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"id\":\"54384029\",\"heading\":\"Use WorldCat.org for school research\",\"image\":null,\"link\":\"/topics/search\",\"bodyCopy\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eLearn additional basic and advanced search techniques in this simple tutorial. We\\u0026rsquo;ll walk through how to get resources for a solar system report that a student might be assigned and also provide tips for college students and more advanced researchers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}],\"exploreFormatsHeading\":\"Explore resources in libraries worldwide\",\"howToUseHeading\":\"How to use WorldCat.org\",\"largeGraphicSection\":[{\"id\":\"54384030\",\"heading\":\"Genealogy\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.25 113w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.5 226w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.75 339w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png 452w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.25\\u0026fm=webp 113w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fm=webp 226w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fm=webp 339w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?fm=webp 452w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png\",\"width\":452,\"height\":452,\"aspectRatio\":1,\"alt\":\"worldcat.org genealogy topic page\",\"title\":\"Genealogy\",\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#a9744e\"}},\"link\":\"/topics/genealogy\",\"bodyCopy\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you\\u0026rsquo;re interested in genealogy or family history, you\\u0026rsquo;re in the right place. Libraries and archives are often the only source for unique, local information about cemetery, burial, and military records; family Bibles, church, and town histories; indexes of births, marriages, and deaths; photographs, newspapers, microfilm, and so much more.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}],\"exploreFormatsMoreInfoLink\":[{\"linkHref\":\"/search?q=worldcat\",\"linkText\":\"View all other resources\"}],\"featuredUserLists\":[{\"title\":\"Eco-literacy for kids\",\"description\":\"The more kids understand about how the natural world work the more likely they are to respect and care for it. Help connect more children with the wonders of the natural world and how each person's choices can impact our shared ecosystems. For more information about the Sustainable Libraries Initiative, visit https://sustainablelibrariesinitiative.org/\",\"id\":\"X7K1qobpQ_G0qEBn3n0sZg\",\"url\":\"https://search.worldcat.org/lists/738e9c96-933c-473c-a426-8680f5816e43\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.25\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162