\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=2\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 564w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 282px) 100vw, 282px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282\",\"width\":282,\"height\":158,\"aspectRatio\":1.782234957020057,\"alt\":null,\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#a67210\"}}},{\"title\":\"Top interlibrary loan requests: September 2026\",\"description\":\"Here are the ten books most frequently requested for interlibrary loan in September 2026 through the OCLC resource sharing network of 10,000+ libraries worldwide.\",\"id\":\"E0rXM_3jTiCSpb5sXP7Nrg\",\"url\":\"https://search.worldcat.org/lists/d7a8ffa7-8051-4ac5-8eda-5ddce72ee43c\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.25\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=1.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=2\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 564w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.25\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=1.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=2\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026fm=webp\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 564w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 282px) 100vw, 282px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282\",\"width\":282,\"height\":158,\"aspectRatio\":1.782234957020057,\"alt\":null,\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#cfa222\"}}},{\"title\":\"Oscar-Nominated Films Based on Books: 2026\",\"description\":\"Read before you watch these Oscar-nominated films!\",\"id\":\"VP5jXOZYRwiDqxIm8pluMw\",\"url\":\"https://search.worldcat.org/lists/2ad8833f-a690-4d26-991e-4b7f5c30d65c\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1779387441-218000-worldcat_lists_imagery_oscar-nominated.png?dpr=0.25\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1779387441-218000-worldcat_lists_imagery_oscar-nominated.png?dpr=0.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1779387441-218000-worldcat_lists_imagery_oscar-nominated.png?dpr=0.75\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1779387441-218000-worldcat_lists_imagery_oscar-nominated.png?fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1779387441-218000-worldcat_lists_imagery_oscar-nominated.png?dpr=1.5\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1779387441-218000-worldcat_lists_imagery_oscar-nominated.png?dpr=2\\u0026fit=clip\\u0026h=162\\u0026w=282 564w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29