ist\",\"description\":\"Lists allow you to keep track of items of interest so you can refer to them whenever you want. You may use lists for a variety of purposes. \"},{\"id\":\"144709704\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364\",\"width\":364,\"height\":204,\"aspectRatio\":1.7822349570200573,\"alt\":\"hands over keyb