            "text": "{\"pageProps\":{\"marketingAsset\":{\"hideDismissButton\":false,\"marketingAssetContent\":[{\"backgroundImage\":{\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1653335343-bg-svg-worldcat.png\"},\"buttonText\":\" \",\"image\":{\"alt\":null,\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1676580923-217084-worldcatfind_ad_blue.png\"},\"imageCarousel\":[],\"imageDescription\":\"WorldCat Find app\",\"linkText\":\"Download now\",\"linkHref\":\"ANDROID=https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.oclc.wcmobile&referrer=utm_source%3Dwc-org%26utm_medium%3Dlaunch-banner-homepage, IOS=https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id1638148949?pt=545842&ct=wc-org-launch-banner-homepage&mt=8\",\"subTitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"\"}]},\"listsLandingPage\":{\"id\":\"87149792\",\"pageTitle\":\"Lists\",\"introSection\":\"<p><span>Lists allow you to keep track of items of interest so you can refer to them whenever you want. You may use lists for a variety of purposes: curating your favorite items, keeping track of items you want to read, or grouping items together by research topics. Best of all, you can also share your lists with friends and colleagues! List invitations can be sent to anyone with an email address, regardless of whether they maintain a WorldCat.org account.</span></p>\\n<p><span>For library staff, lists are a powerful tool to highlight items from your collections. For example, you could use lists to curate seasonal reading materials or broadcast items related to trending cultural topics. Library-curated lists are promoted to users on our home page and are a great way to showcase the unique strengths of your library&rsquo;s collections. WorldCat.org staff accounts enable multiple library staff to collaborate on shared library-associated lists.</span></p>\",\"howToCreateListHeading\":\"Creating a list is as easy as 1, 2, 3\",\"howToCreateListContent\":[{\"bodyCopy\":\"<ol>\\n  <li><span>From the Item Details screen, click &ldquo;Add.&rdquo;</span></li>\\n  <li><span>From the Add item to a list dialog, click &ldquo;Create New&rdquo; to open the Create new list dialog.</span></li>\\n  <li><span>From the \\\"Create New\\\" list dialog, enter the list name and description, select a privacy setting, and click &ldquo;Create.&rdquo;</span></li>\\n</ol>\\n<div><span>Individual users can create up to 50 lists, each with up to 500 items; institutional users using library staff accounts can create an unlimited number of lists, each also up to 500 items. For additional information on creating and managing lists, visit </span><span style=\\\"font-size: 0.9375rem; letter-spacing: 0px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://help.oclc.org/Discovery_and_Reference/WorldCat-org/WorldCat_lists\\\">WorldCat.org documentation</a> or <a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1b_Eov7DzMw&amp;list=PLWXaAShGazu6iqighI8cT9p02FDkG2qO7&amp;index=3&amp;pp=iAQB\\\">watch a video</a> about h</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 0.9375rem; letter-spacing: 0px;\\\">ow to create and share lists on WorldCat.org.</span></div>\\n<div></div>\",\"id\":\"93795251\",\"heading\":\"How do I create a list?\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1641333018-create-list.svg?fit=max&h=141&w=138\",\"alt\":\"createlist\"}}]},\"homePage\":{\"pageTitle\":\"Find items in libraries near you\",\"exploreFormats\":[{\"id\":\"54384021\",\"formatText\":\"Books\",\"icon\":{\"alt\":\"Books\",\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1631281099-books.svg\"},\"numberString\":\"405 million\"},{\"id\":\"54384022\",\"formatText\":\"Articles\",\"icon\":{\"alt\":\"Articles\",\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1635515431-article-chapter.svg\"},\"numberString\":\"440 million\"},{\"id\":\"54384023\",\"formatText\":\"Sound recordings\",\"icon\":{\"alt\":\"Sound recordings\",\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1631281138-sound-recordings.svg\"},\"numberString\":\"25 million\"},{\"id\":\"54384024\",\"formatText\":\"Musical scores\",\"icon\":{\"alt\":\"Musical scores\",\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1631281160-musical-scores.svg\"},\"numberString\":\"10 million\"},{\"id\":\"54384025\",\"formatText\":\"Maps\",\"icon\":{\"alt\":\"Maps\",\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1631281178-map.svg\"},\"numberString\":\"6 million\"},{\"id\":\"54384026\",\"formatText\":\"Theses/Dissertations\",\"icon\":{\"alt\":\"Theses\",\"url\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1631281194-theses.svg\"},\"numberString\":\"30 million\"}],\"featuredInterests\":[{\"id\":\"54384033\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_sharelists.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364\",\"width\":364,\"height\":204,\"aspectRatio\":1.7822349570200573,\"alt\":\"mobile website view of searchworldcat.org.\",\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#3da7d2\"}},\"label\":\"Share a list \",\"relativeLinkHref\":\"/lists\",\"title\":\"Share a list\",\"description\":\"Lists allow you to keep track of items of interest so you can refer to them whenever you want. You may use lists for a variety of purposes. \"},{\"id\":\"144709704\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055902-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_createanaccount.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364\",\"width\":364,\"height\":204,\"aspectRatio\":1.7822349570200573,\"alt\":\"hands over keyboard of a laptop\",\"title\":\"\",\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#1074c3\"}},\"label\":\"Create an account \",\"relativeLinkHref\":\"/create-account \",\"title\":\"Create an account \",\"description\":\"In two minutes, learn to create a WorldCat.org profile, add items to lists, generate citations, and refine your search using facets. \"},{\"id\":\"54384032\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.25&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 91w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 182w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=0.75&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 273w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 364w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?dpr=1.5&fit=max&fm=webp&h=242&w=364 546w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 364px) 100vw, 364px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1747055897-217606_worldcatorg_homepageimage_622x349px_trendingtitles.png?fit=max&h=242&w=364\",\"width\":364,\"height\":204,\"aspectRatio\":1.7822349570200573,\"alt\":\"Hands flipping through a book at a table\",\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#c97836\"}},\"label\":\"Trending titles \",\"relativeLinkHref\":\"/lists/d7a8ffa7-8051-4ac5-8eda-5ddce72ee43c\",\"title\":\"Trending titles\",\"description\":\"Here are the ten books most frequently requested for interlibrary loan each month. \"}],\"featuredStaffList\":[{\"listId\":\"40adb58c-db5f-4f2d-9de3-5163b8651f9a\"}],\"howToUseContent\":[{\"id\":\"54384028\",\"heading\":\"Welcome to WorldCat.org\",\"image\":null,\"link\":\"/topics/welcome\",\"bodyCopy\":\"<p>Get started with WorldCat.org. In about two minutes, you can learn how to make a WorldCat.org profile, create and add items to lists, export citations, and use facets to narrow your search criteria. It&rsquo;s a quick way to introduce yourself to the basics of searching the world&rsquo;s largest collection of information about materials in libraries.</p>\"},{\"id\":\"54384029\",\"heading\":\"Use WorldCat.org for school research\",\"image\":null,\"link\":\"/topics/search\",\"bodyCopy\":\"<p>Learn additional basic and advanced search techniques in this simple tutorial. We&rsquo;ll walk through how to get resources for a solar system report that a student might be assigned and also provide tips for college students and more advanced researchers.</p>\"}],\"exploreFormatsHeading\":\"Explore resources in libraries worldwide\",\"howToUseHeading\":\"How to use WorldCat.org\",\"largeGraphicSection\":[{\"id\":\"54384030\",\"heading\":\"Genealogy\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.25 113w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.5 226w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.75 339w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png 452w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.25&fm=webp 113w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.5&fm=webp 226w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?dpr=0.75&fm=webp 339w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png?fm=webp 452w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 452px) 100vw, 452px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1645194556-216938_geneolog-homepage-image.png\",\"width\":452,\"height\":452,\"aspectRatio\":1,\"alt\":\"worldcat.org genealogy topic page\",\"title\":\"Genealogy\",\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#a9744e\"}},\"link\":\"/topics/genealogy\",\"bodyCopy\":\"<p>If you&rsquo;re interested in genealogy or family history, you&rsquo;re in the right place. Libraries and archives are often the only source for unique, local information about cemetery, burial, and military records; family Bibles, church, and town histories; indexes of births, marriages, and deaths; photographs, newspapers, microfilm, and so much more.</p>\"}],\"exploreFormatsMoreInfoLink\":[{\"linkHref\":\"/search?q=worldcat\",\"linkText\":\"View all other resources\"}],\"featuredUserLists\":[{\"title\":\"Eco-literacy for kids\",\"description\":\"The more kids understand about how the natural world work the more likely they are to respect and care for it. Help connect more children with the wonders of the natural world and how each person's choices can impact our shared ecosystems. For more information about the Sustainable Libraries Initiative, visit https://sustainablelibrariesinitiative.org/\",\"id\":\"X7K1qobpQ_G0qEBn3n0sZg\",\"url\":\"https://search.worldcat.org/lists/738e9c96-933c-473c-a426-8680f5816e43\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.25&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.5&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.75&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?fit=clip&h=162&w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=1.5&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=2&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 564w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=3&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 846w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=4&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 1128w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.25&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.5&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=0.75&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=1.5&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=2&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 564w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=3&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 846w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?dpr=4&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 1128w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 282px) 100vw, 282px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1715955970-eco.png?fit=clip&h=162&w=282\",\"width\":282,\"height\":158,\"aspectRatio\":1.7777777777777777,\"alt\":null,\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#adca1e\"}}},{\"title\":\"Nature Documentaries\",\"description\":\"From snow-capped mountains to wildlife thriving in the cold, experience the beauty of nature from the warmth of your home. Perfect for your winter watchlist!\",\"id\":\"143575374\",\"url\":\"https://search.worldcat.org/search?q=nature+documentary&itemType=video&itemSubType=video-dvd%2Cvideo-vhs%2Cvideo-digital%2Cvideo-film%2Cvideo-bluray&_gl=1*1i1qyyd*_ga*MjgzMzM0OTMyLjE2NTA0NjY5ODY.*_ga_C9J93E8RHJ*MTcyODkyNzk3NS4xMTgxLjEuMTcyODkyODI5MC4wLjAuMA\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=0.25&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=0.5&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=0.75&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?fit=clip&h=162&w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=1.5&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=2&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 564w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=0.25&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=0.5&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=0.75&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=1.5&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?dpr=2&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 564w\",\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 282px) 100vw, 282px\",\"src\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1731527297-216938_wcdotorg_naturedcoumentary_622x349.png?fit=clip&h=162&w=282\",\"width\":282,\"height\":158,\"aspectRatio\":1.782234957020057,\"alt\":null,\"title\":null,\"base64\":\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\",\"bgColor\":\"#a67210\"}}},{\"title\":\"Top interlibrary loan requests: September 2026\",\"description\":\"Here are the ten books most frequently requested for interlibrary loan in September 2026 through the OCLC resource sharing network of 10,000+ libraries worldwide.\",\"id\":\"E0rXM_3jTiCSpb5sXP7Nrg\",\"url\":\"https://search.worldcat.org/lists/d7a8ffa7-8051-4ac5-8eda-5ddce72ee43c\",\"image\":{\"responsiveImage\":{\"srcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.25&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.5&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.75&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 211w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?fit=clip&h=162&w=282 282w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=1.5&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 423w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=2&fit=clip&h=162&w=282 564w\",\"webpSrcSet\":\"https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.25&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 70w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/29926/1689275404-ill-book-list.png?dpr=0.5&fit=clip&fm=webp&h=162&w=282 141w,https://www.datocms-asse